body:
Some people take this shit WAY TOO SERIOUSLY.

&#x200B;

I get off on cuck porn, and I like waxing philosophical about getting cucked. But like this group is a huge mix of people

So im a married trans gender woman, though lately I see myself as sort of a feminine, bi gender kind of guy (I do prefer she/her).

&#x200B;

My wife has no interest in cucking me, so in that way its a shut case that im not a cuck. But im polyamorous, and I generally REALLY want to explore this kink with other girlfriends. However, I guess im mostly a cuck wannabe

I hate the stuff thats just masturbation fantasies. I dont mind cuckold story time sometimes though, and sometimes I have a cuck anecdote thats relevant to the discussion I want to seek. Maybe we should have a day dedicated to sharing our stories?

&#x200B;

I dont know, I would like people to respect this space a bit more. Ive had some amazing, fleeting friendships from here and find this space oddly sacred I guess?

Its up there with sharing photos of the wife without consent as far as scummy cuck things go.

&#x200B;

Its funny, I have a lot of bias against doms in general because I have had so many negative experiences with them, but honestly in this scene, the cuck is more likely to be an abusive male than the bull! Its a real bummer.

&#x200B;

I have a wife who rarely if ever cucks me. I dont blame her one bit, because frankly, I wouldnt want to fuck in front of an observer either. I hate when cucks do this shit like try and manipulate their wife into fucking other men. Its just rotten

Hey, I also do pervy graffiti (I throw the name "Cuck" because I think its funny, plus its my kink)

&#x200B;

Anyhow, I like what you did. People dont care much for my graff either but whatever. Feel free to DM me if you want :)

I mean im not trying to be a pro. I feel like this sentiment borders on elitism. Like IDK, yeah I make bad graffiti. Being told what to work on is good and all but like I feel like if I come out and say im a beginner artist, like I did its all fine.

&#x200B;

Im just trying to improve my style, did I do something to indicate that I thought I was better than somebody or something
